/// Asserts that every non-blank value in a column ends with the given suffix. Uses RIGHT() (DAX has no ENDSWITH). Pass "Y" for matchCase to compare case-sensitively; default is case-insensitive.
function 'PQL.Assert.Col.ShouldEndWith' =
